## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的步驟從「想法到落地」給你一個清晰的藍圖，涵蓋設計、技術選型、開發、測試與部署。你可以根據自己的需求、團隊規模和預算靈活調整。

| 步驟 | 目標 | 具體做法 | 工具/技術 |
|------|------|----------|-----------|
| 1. 需求分析 | 明確功能、目標用戶、商業邏輯 | - 用戶故事<br>- 功能清單（商品瀏覽、搜尋、篩選、購物車、結帳、支付、訂單管理、評論、個人中心）<br>- 商業規則（折扣、庫存、物流） | Jira / Trello / Notion |
| 2. UI/UX 設計 | 讓界面既美觀又易用 | - 先畫線框圖（Wireframe）<br>- 設計高保真原型（Mockup）<br>- 進行可用性測試 | Figma / Sketch / Adobe XD |
| 3. 技術棧決策 | 選擇最適合的前端框架、樣式庫、工具 | - **框架**：React / Vue / Angular<br>- **狀態管理**：Redux / Vuex / Pinia / Zustand<br>- **樣式**：Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap / Material UI<br>- **打包**：Vite / Webpack / CRA<br>- **API**：REST / GraphQL | 依團隊熟悉度與項目規模決定 |
| 4. 建立專案結構 | 方便維護、擴展 | ```bash<br>npx create-react-app ecommerce-frontend --template typescript<br>cd ecommerce-frontend<br>npm i tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer<br>npx tailwindcss init -p<br>``` | 以 React + TypeScript 為例 |
| 5. 核心功能實作 | 商品列表、搜尋、篩選、購物車、結帳 | - **商品列表**：使用虛擬滾動（react-window）提升性能<br>- **搜尋**：前端即時搜尋 + 後端 API 搜索<br>- **篩選**：多層級篩選器（價格、品牌、評分）<br>- **購物車**：本地存儲 + Redux<br>- **結帳**：表單驗證、支付 SDK（Stripe / PayPal） | React Router, Axios, Formik, Yup |
| 6. API 整合 | 從後端獲取資料 | ```ts<br>import axios from 'axios';\n\nconst api = axios.create({ baseURL: '/api' });\nexport const fetchProducts = (params) => api.get('/products', { params });\n``` | Axios / Fetch |
| 7. 響應式 & 無障礙 | 兼容手機、平板、桌面；符合 WCAG | - 使用 Tailwind 的響應式類別<br>- ARIA 標籤、語義化 HTML<br>- 測試工具：axe-core | axe-core, Lighthouse |
| 8. 性能優化 | 加快首屏渲染、減少 bundle 大小 | - Code splitting（React.lazy + Suspense）<br>- 圖片懶加載（react-lazyload）<br>- CDN、gzip、HTTP/2 | Webpack Bundle Analyzer |
| 9. 測試 | 保證功能正確、UI 不回退 | - 單元測試：Jest + React Testing Library<br>- 集成測試：Cypress<br>- 視覺回歸：Percy | Jest, Cypress, Percy |
| 10. CI/CD | 自動化測試、部署 | - GitHub Actions / GitLab CI<br>- 部署到 Vercel / Netlify / Firebase Hosting | GitHub Actions, Vercel |
| 11. SEO & Analytics | 提升搜索排名、追蹤用戶行為 | - SSR / SSG（Next.js / Nuxt.js）<br>- Meta tags、structured data<br>- Google Analytics / Mixpanel | Next.js, react-helmet |
| 12. 上線 & 監控 | 監測錯誤、性能、用戶行為 | - Sentry、LogRocket<br>- New Relic、Datadog | Sentry, LogRocket |

---

## 具體實作範例（React + Tailwind）

### 1. 商品列表頁

```tsx
// src/pages/ProductList.tsx
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import { fetchProducts } from '../api/products';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard';

const ProductList = () => {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState([]);
  const [page, setPage] = useState(1);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  const loadMore = async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    const res = await fetchProducts({ page, limit: 20 });
    setProducts(prev => [...prev, ...res.data]);
    setLoading(false);
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    loadMore();
  }, []);

  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto p-4">
      <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">商品列表</h1>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        {products.map(p => (
          <ProductCard key={p.id} product={p} />
        ))}
      </div>
      {loading && <p className="text-center mt-4">載入中...</p>}
      <button
        onClick={loadMore}
        className="mt-4 w-full py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-700"
      >
        加載更多
      </button>
    </div>
  );
};

export default ProductList;
```

### 2. 購物車（Redux Slice）

```ts
// src/store/cartSlice.ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

interface CartItem {
  productId: number;
  quantity: number;
}

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
}

const initialState: CartState = {
  items: [],
};

const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<CartItem>) {
      const existing = state.items.find(i => i.productId === action.payload.productId);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<number>) {
      state.items = state.items.filter(i => i.productId !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart(state) {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

### 3. 結帳頁（Stripe Integration）

```tsx
// src/pages/Checkout.tsx
import { loadStripe } from '@stripe/stripe-js';
import { Elements, CardElement, useStripe, useElements } from '@stripe/react-stripe-js';
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { clearCart } from '../store/cartSlice';

const stripePromise = loadStripe(process.env.REACT_APP_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY!);

const CheckoutForm = () => {
  const stripe = useStripe();
  const elements = useElements();
  const cart = useSelector((state: any) => state.cart.items);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    if (!stripe || !elements) return;

    // 1. Create PaymentIntent on server
    const { data } = await fetch('/api/create-payment-intent', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ items: cart }),
    }).then(r => r.json());

    // 2. Confirm card payment
    const result = await stripe.confirmCardPayment(data.clientSecret, {
      payment_method: {
        card: elements.getElement(CardElement),
      },
    });

    if (result.error) {
      alert(result.error.message);
    } else {
      if (result.paymentIntent.status === 'succeeded') {
        alert('支付成功！');
        dispatch(clearCart());
      }
    }
  };

  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className="max-w-md mx-auto p-4 border rounded">
      <CardElement className="mb-4" />
      <button
        type="submit"
        disabled={!stripe}
        className="w-full py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-green-700"
      >
        完成支付
      </button>
    </form>
  );
};

const Checkout = () => (
  <Elements stripe={stripePromise}>
    <CheckoutForm />
  </Elements>
);

export default Checkout;
```

